@@FILE README.md
# FitTrack v5

Android fitness/nutrition tracker (Kotlin + Jetpack Compose).

## Food catalog
- Open Food Facts: branded products and barcode lookup, no key required.
- USDA FoodData Central: general + branded foods. `DEMO_KEY` works for testing; add your own data.gov API key in **Ещё → База продуктов → Настроить USDA** for normal limits.
- Local history, favorites and manual foods remain available.

## Build
Open the project in current Android Studio, install Android SDK 35 if prompted, then Build → Build APK(s).
This archive does not contain a Gradle wrapper binary because the build environment used to prepare it has no Android SDK/Gradle distribution and cannot download build tooling.
@@END
